988
01:09:46,830 --> 01:09:50,830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: which has an affirmative approval from the DSOD,

989
01:09:50,830 --> 01:09:55,830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: recently DSOD before the HLURV or the NCV.

990
01:09:55,830 --> 01:10:01,830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: And that is the reason why in the exercise of adjudicatory power of DAR,

991
01:10:01,830 --> 01:10:04,830
