01:10:14,830 --> 01:10:18,830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: on appeal to the Court of Appeals and to the Supreme Court,

994
01:10:18,830 --> 01:10:19,830
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: we lost the case.

995
01:10:19,830 --> 01:10:29,530
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: This is the situation of the heirs of GALA versus the samahan ng mamamamayan ng saryaya.

