2323
02:01:31,240 --> 02:01:35,360
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: We now move to Rep. Sara Elago.

2324
02:01:36,500 --> 02:01:42,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Magandang hapon, Mr. Secretary, sa ating officials at sa buong DAR family.

2325
02:01:42,920 --> 02:01:47,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating sa land use conversion, kailan huling nagkaroon ng revalidation?

2326
02:01:48,160 --> 02:01:59,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ng status ng ARBs ang DAR? Ilan ang ARBs na kasalukuyang pagmamay-ari pa nila at nasa kontrol pa nila ang mga lands na awarded?

2327
02:01:59,160 --> 02:02:13,740
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Iyon hong in-charge sa mga conversion po. Narito po sa aking tabi. With your permission po, siya po ang pasasagutin ko. Si Undersecretary Galit. With the permission of the Chairman.

2328
02:02:13,740 --> 02:02:16,520
Rep. Ian Paul L. Dy: Yes, may we hear from Usec Galit?

2329
02:02:18,160 --> 02:02:23,420
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Maraming salamat po, Honorable Chair, Congresswoman Elagong. Maraming salamat po.

2330
02:02:23,960 --> 02:02:45,460
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang tungkol po sa inyong katanungan na kung ilan ang mga farmers na naapektuhan ng conversion at kung sila pa rin ang nakapwisto doon sa kanilang lupa na inapply ang for conversion, ito po ang masasabi ko po.

2331
02:02:45,460 --> 02:03:04,020
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Tama po yun na yung karamihan po na siya naman binigyan ng batas, ng karapatan ng batas, doon po sa Section 16, Section 65 ng Republic Act 6657,

2332
02:03:04,480 --> 02:03:15,020
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: yung atin din pong mga manggagawa na kung saan ang mga CLOA ay na-issue na may mga limang taon na ay hinahayaan

2333
02:03:15,460 --> 02:03:32,260
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: na mag-file ng conversion. Ngayon, ang pag-file nila ng conversion, e para sa FORFOS na maging mas productive yung kanilang economic growth doon sa kanilang lupa na kanilang sinasaka, na hinahayaan naman at pinapahintulutan ng batas.

2334
02:03:32,260 --> 02:03:44,280
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang tanging namin inaano doon sa mga farmers na nag-a-apply for conversion, ang katanungan na palagi namin sinasabi,

2335
02:03:44,920 --> 02:03:45,260
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: kinakailangan,

2336
02:03:45,460 --> 02:04:03,120
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: kinakailangan po, yung pong lupa ay hindi irrigated at hindi irrigable with firm funding commitment na naaayong po sa ating Administrative Order 01, 02, 01, Series of 2002, EO 01, Series of 2019.

2337
02:04:03,880 --> 02:04:15,240
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ngayon po, yung pong mga farmers na yan na Honorable Ma'am, kinanagpile sila ng conversion.

2338
02:04:15,460 --> 02:04:18,560
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang pagmamayari po, nasa kanila pa rin po.

2339
02:04:19,500 --> 02:04:24,620
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: May mga pagkakataon po lang na sila ay nag-judge and venture ng isang debilo fair.

2340
02:04:25,340 --> 02:04:36,300
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: So, in which case, yung pong debilo fair at saka yung agrarian reform beneficiaries, nagsishare po sila sa pakinabang ng lupa na kanilang sinasaka.

2341
02:04:37,700 --> 02:04:39,540
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Marami po yun. Tama po kayo.

2342
02:04:40,200 --> 02:04:44,220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Marami po sa nag-a-apply ng conversion, karamihan po ay manggagawa.

2343
02:04:44,220 --> 02:04:45,220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Na hindi...

2344
02:04:45,460 --> 02:04:53,220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Rin po namin po pwedeng tanggihan, ayon sa batas, basta nasa tama po yung kalagayan ng kanilang lupa.

2345
02:04:53,860 --> 02:04:57,560
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: At sa ngayon po, sila pa rin po ang nakikinabang sa kanilang lupa.

2346
02:04:59,280 --> 02:05:01,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you for the update, Mr. Chair.

2347
02:05:01,480 --> 02:05:03,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: But my questions have not been answered.

2348
02:05:03,260 --> 02:05:14,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: My question po is, when is the last time DAR has undertaken a revalidation of the status of ARBs?

2349
02:05:14,800 --> 02:05:15,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kailan po?

2350
02:05:15,340 --> 02:05:18,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kailan po kayo huli na nagsagawa po ng revalidation?

2351
02:05:19,600 --> 02:05:21,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ongoing po ba ito?

2352
02:05:21,620 --> 02:05:24,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O ginagawa natin by face?

2353
02:05:24,520 --> 02:05:26,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nasaan na po tayo pagdating sa revalidation?

2354
02:05:26,760 --> 02:05:32,100
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ma'am, regarding po sa revalidation ng mga ARBs tungkol sa status ng mga farmers,

2355
02:05:32,780 --> 02:05:35,040
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: for the information of the committee,

2356
02:05:35,680 --> 02:05:39,000
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: sa aming po sa DAR as an agency, we have a lot of sectors.

2357
02:05:39,520 --> 02:05:42,880
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Meron po kaming tinatawag na sectors of field operation office,

2358
02:05:42,880 --> 02:05:44,880
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: na siyang nangangasiwa doon sa pagpapalilisan.

2359
02:05:45,340 --> 02:05:50,200
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Sa mga kalagayan ng mga farmers, ilan ba sila na nag-apply ng conversion?

2360
02:05:50,860 --> 02:05:54,260
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: At kung sila pa rin ba ang nakaposition sa mga lupa na yan?

2361
02:05:54,820 --> 02:06:01,380
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Yan pong revalidation namin tungkol dyan sa kalagayan ng farmers is an ongoing concern.

2362
02:06:01,800 --> 02:06:10,760
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Wala pong non-stop po yan under the monitoring po at supervision ng ating ahinsya, ang DAR.

2363
02:06:11,480 --> 02:06:12,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

2364
02:06:12,420 --> 02:06:15,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we also get the numbers, Mr. Chair?

2365
02:06:15,340 --> 02:06:18,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang sabi niyo ho kanina na may mga nag-apply for conversion,

2366
02:06:19,780 --> 02:06:23,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ilang ARBs ito at ilang hektarya yung gagamitin

2367
02:06:23,380 --> 02:06:26,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at sa kasalukuyan na suma sa ilalim sa land use conversion?

2368
02:06:27,080 --> 02:06:35,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At maaari niyo ho bang maibahagi sa amin kung ilan dito yung para sa residential, commercial, industrial o institutional na paggamit?

2369
02:06:36,100 --> 02:06:36,740
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Tama po yan.

2370
02:06:37,100 --> 02:06:41,920
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Nangangakaw po kami sa inyo, Honorable Ma'am, na isasubmit sa inyo

2371
02:06:42,220 --> 02:06:45,320
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: yung total na detail, data,

2372
02:06:45,340 --> 02:06:50,700
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: ng land holdings na nakapag-apply ng conversion,

2373
02:06:50,940 --> 02:06:53,340
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: kung ilan ang mga farmers ang nag-apply ng conversions,

2374
02:06:54,020 --> 02:07:01,340
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: at kung ilan naman na ang nag-apply naman yung mga regular titles na hindi na-covered ng ating coverage sa 6657.

2375
02:07:02,820 --> 02:07:07,200
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Nangangakaw po kami sa inyo na ipapadala po namin sa inyo sa lalong madaling panahon, Ma'am.

2376
02:07:07,720 --> 02:07:12,000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, we will welcome the submission from DAR on this matter.

2377
02:07:12,000 --> 02:07:15,120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Now, there is this study.

2378
02:07:15,340 --> 02:07:20,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Conducted by the UP Department of Geodetic Engineering

2379
02:07:20,100 --> 02:07:26,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol po sa issue ng land use conversion sa probinsya ng Tarla.

2380
02:07:26,420 --> 02:07:30,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa kanilang pag-aaral mula 2017 hanggang 2022,

2381
02:07:31,080 --> 02:07:37,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang agricultural lands ay lumiit from 50.19% to 47.64%

2382
02:07:37,720 --> 02:07:44,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: habang nag-triple naman sa bilang at porsyento, 333.3%.

2383
02:07:45,340 --> 02:07:48,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang expansion ng mga solar farms.

2384
02:07:49,420 --> 02:07:51,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito ho ba ay alam ng DAR?

2385
02:07:52,360 --> 02:07:59,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ano ho ang sinasagawa natin para matiyak na napoprotektahan pa rin natin ang ating agricultural lands?

2386
02:07:59,840 --> 02:08:05,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang kasabay nitong malawakan at mabilisan na expansion ng mga solar farms.

2387
02:08:07,320 --> 02:08:08,640
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ganito po yan, Ma'am.

2388
02:08:08,920 --> 02:08:12,920
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Yung pong dalawang niyang bahagi, yung pong para sa elektrisidad,

2389
02:08:13,860 --> 02:08:15,180
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: at saka yung...

2390
02:08:15,340 --> 02:08:20,560
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Yung pong tungkol sa ating mga ARBs, sa ating mga farmers,

2391
02:08:21,320 --> 02:08:28,300
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: ito po ay parihas sa binabanggit at pinapaprotektahan din ho ng ating saligang batas.

2392
02:08:29,120 --> 02:08:34,480
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Yung pong sa mga farmers, ang tinatawag po natin na protection na ibinibigay dyan ay yung social justice.

2393
02:08:34,480 --> 02:08:43,480
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang tungkol sa pagpapalago ng agraryo, which is, according to our president, is a foundational approach.

2394
02:08:43,480 --> 02:08:51,960
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: At yung isa naman po, elektrisidad, pangangailangan din po ng buong Pilipino, ng buong kabayanan,

2395
02:08:52,620 --> 02:09:00,620
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: na atin namang pinapangalagaan ng ating 1987 Constitution, na tinatawag naman po natin na General Welfare Clause.

2396
02:09:01,280 --> 02:09:04,900
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ito po ay parihas namin binabalansi at inaalagaan.

2397
02:09:04,900 --> 02:09:12,960
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Kaya nga po, dito kapag dumating na sa amin ang isang application for conversions under the Land Use Case Committee,

2398
02:09:13,480 --> 02:09:20,400
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: at nakita namin kay farmers siya na nag-apply, kay regular land owners siya na nag-apply,

2399
02:09:21,220 --> 02:09:25,920
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: tapos kumplito ang requirement niya at naaayon sa batas.

2400
02:09:26,540 --> 02:09:35,080
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Kami po, ma'am, ay wala rin hong discretion kasi kundi ang ibigay at i-approve ang kanyang konversyon.

2401
02:09:35,400 --> 02:09:42,360
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ngayon po, tungkol po doon sa ginagawang inventory ng ibang ahinsya ng pamahalaan,

2402
02:09:42,360 --> 02:09:54,040
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: tama lang po iyon at kami po ay magkipag-coordinate sa kanila para makipag-exchange note kami tungkol naman sa data namin dito sa DAR

2403
02:09:54,040 --> 02:10:05,020
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: at saka doon sa ahinsya na nag-conduct din ng kanilang tinatawag na survey na parang lumiliit ang agricultural lot

2404
02:10:05,020 --> 02:10:09,140
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: because of the conversion of this renewable energy.

2405
02:10:09,760 --> 02:10:12,340
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Natural lang po, ma'am, hindi po ako pupunta.

2406
02:10:12,360 --> 02:10:19,000
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Kung pwedeng makatanggi na kapag nagkaroon ng konversyon, nakakabawas sa ating agricultural.

2407
02:10:19,960 --> 02:10:29,220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Pero sa akin, ang masasabi ko po, supesyente pa rin po ang lawak ng kalupaan para po sa ating agricultural

2408
02:10:29,220 --> 02:10:34,060
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: na nangangailangan lang po ng suporta ng modern agriculture.

2409
02:10:34,840 --> 02:10:39,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang Department of Agriculture, Mr. Chair, meron silang sinisimula na geofencing program

2410
02:10:39,700 --> 02:10:41,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para protektahan yung ating agriculture.

2411
02:10:42,360 --> 02:10:42,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa akin, ang mga ating agricultural lands.

2412
02:10:42,840 --> 02:10:47,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil tama po kayo, parehong napakahalaga sa sambayan ng Pilipino.

2413
