2423
02:12:01,800 --> 02:12:10,700
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang masasabi ko dyan, maski na ang BCDA na host charter under Republic Act 7227,

2424
02:12:10,720 --> 02:12:23,680
