2425
02:12:24,620 --> 02:12:37,220
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: Ang aming pong protection na ibinibigay sa ARBs, kung sakasakaling dumating sa punto na yung lupa na nasasakop nila at may kluwa at tatamaan ng expropriation,

2426
02:12:37,220 --> 02:12:40,560
DAR Undersecretary for Legal Affairs Atty. Napoleon U. Galit: we will definitely contest the validity.

2427
